# Dataset — public (Roboflow/Mendeley, CC BY 4.0) and small: versioned on purpose
# so the results are reproducible and visible in the repo. If a future dataset is
# heavy, ignore that specific subfolder here instead of the whole data/ tree.

# Model outputs: training result artifacts (metrics, plots, sample batches) ARE
# versioned to show results. Only the heavy binaries stay out (regenerable, bloat git).
runs/
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.tflite
*.pkl

# System / IDE
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Private layer — NEVER pushed. Real names, company docs, supervisor chats.
# This is the local-only side of the "one project, two layers" setup.
_private/
